{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04129","headline":"拟古三首 三 · 徐彦伯","name":"拟古三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"頽光无淹晷，逝水有迅流。\n绿苔纷易歇，红颜不再求。\n歌笑当及春，无令壮志秋。\n弱年仕关辅，簃门豁御沟。\n敷愉东城际，婉娈南陌头。\n荷花娇绿水，杨叶暖青楼。\n中有绮罗人，可怜名莫愁。\n画屏绕金膝，珠帘悬玉钩。\n纤指调宝琴，泠泠哀且柔。\n赠君鸳鸯带，因以鷫鸘裘。\n窗晓吟日坐，闺夕秉烛游。\n无作北门客，咄咄怀百忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}